# Paths PreMan must never overwrite.
#
# Everything else under docs/ is generated from the API contract on every
# release, so anything hand-written outside this list will be replaced without
# warning. PreMan reads this file from the repository root before it writes,
# reports what it left alone in the pull request body, and always protects
# .fernignore itself.

# The landing page. PreMan emits a generic one for repositories that have no
# docs site yet; this repository has a real one.
docs/index.md

# Hand-written narrative that has no equivalent in an OpenAPI document.
docs/getting-started.md
